OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed as firefighters
OL,4,Atackle town centre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout six crews are fighting a fire in
OL,7,Fa town centre building.
OL,9,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,10,Fwas called at about 18:00 GMT to Falcon
OL,11,FStreet in Ipswich.
OL,13,FIt said the fire was in a three-storey
OL,14,Fbuilding consisting of a basement,
OL,15,Fground-floor commercial unit and flats
OL,16,Fon the first floor.
OL,18,FPeople have been asked to avoid the
OL,19,Farea.
